<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Others on A Moment's Rest</title><link>https://a-moment096.github.io/en/categories/others/</link><description>Recent content in Others on A Moment's Rest</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 10 Jul 2026 15:09:16 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://a-moment096.github.io/en/categories/others/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Rescuing a Code Repository Accidentally Deleted by git-reset</title><link>https://a-moment096.github.io/en/posts/others/rescue_my_repository/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 Dec 2025 00:13:03 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://a-moment096.github.io/en/posts/others/rescue_my_repository/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://a-moment096.github.io/images/%E8%BF%B7%E8%BF%AD%E9%A6%99.png" alt="Featured image of post Rescuing a Code Repository Accidentally Deleted by git-reset" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some idiot mistakenly used &lt;code&gt;git reset --hard&lt;/code&gt;. This is what happened to him.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The header image features adorable Rosemary! Drawn by Pixiv artist &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.pixiv.net/users/38336697" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;赌上厨师生涯的拼好饭&lt;/a&gt;, here&amp;rsquo;s the &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/138994056" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;original link&lt;/a&gt;. The track is a Touhou doujin piece I&amp;rsquo;ve been listening to a lot lately: &lt;strong&gt;encourager&lt;/strong&gt;, the first track from &lt;a class="link" href="http://www.rd-sounds.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;凋叶棕 (RD-Sounds)&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rsquo;s album &lt;strong&gt;望 (Bou)&lt;/strong&gt;. The melody is positive and uplifting, bright and cheerful. The blonde kid on the album cover is so cute — can you even argue with that!?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>One Year of the Blog!</title><link>https://a-moment096.github.io/en/posts/others/blog_1st_anniversary/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 15:51:11 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://a-moment096.github.io/en/posts/others/blog_1st_anniversary/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://a-moment096.github.io/images/bouquet.png" alt="Featured image of post One Year of the Blog!" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The header image is from &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/68232005" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;bouquet&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.pixiv.net/users/2642047" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;アシマ&lt;/a&gt;. The track is an insert song from a certain game, &lt;strong&gt;玉響時間 (Tamayura Time)&lt;/strong&gt; — it&amp;rsquo;s just incredibly pleasant, the kind that relaxes your entire body. Really wonderful, I hope you like it too.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

